ame": "011.RS_D+_Screenshot_03.png", "id": "1062786108591961", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830890_1062786111925294_6820825958812217735_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RtRcJk9d1M4Q7kNvwHFlEVz&_nc_oc=Adp8f9_WYZm1KV9y_BZKnkA3-hCVYbJ460Gs4A_yfDbrCUjkLOm4mF7fi1UksS1iqB4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1EiU7xcSb0F45Ew3K6JixmOT5mbfj3_Wu1gCsWjEspbw&oe=69F0B5AD"}, {"file_name": "012.RS_D+_Screenshot_04.png", "id": "1888807391681363", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308589_1888807395014696_660138509703032651_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NIwyoac_7qoQ7kNvwFr9dzi&_nc_oc=Ado8HP-bZIYXPu5FPL9oDr4A5xkecHKcu-v8S3YHzxB6bOhZ2jPrtLS7IzjINHYVExI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1_e2imuGw-EnBzSMV1K2lZyxK84lc1Bbj5hXBwxZKqiA&oe=69F0C43A"}, {"file_name": "009.RS_D+_Screenshot_01.png", "id": "4068036953513638", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292867_4068036956846971_624713770870370506_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j4cxGu2XjaAQ7kNvwG8pk4a&_nc_oc=AdqY4HUr86BY0c5Ice7ApH0sqh3cj8eicGwnr8iFcvqL1ilmF7nexE8prXe3us7YySM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af08p-xHLnVYeyMEe9mW0qFBG8ibq_zAzL949a0kKrmGUQ&oe=69F0AB21"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RS-Dental+", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Important: More content is available with institutional registration.\n\nRSD+ is a VR-based simulator for dental radiographic diagnosis and practice, providing students with a realistic environment to train in radiography procedures without exposure to radiation.\n\nThrough various scenario-based simulations, learners can train in patient interaction, chart review, clinical assessment, X-ray equipment handling, film positioning, and post-exam image review.\n\n With VRAD's patented medical image processing algorithm, X-ray images are dynamically generated based